jobs.description:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Delivery Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active DV Clearance is desirable for this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: competitive depending upon experience + benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hybrid (home-based &amp;amp; working with Kerv Digital office/customer site visits as required) Office locations – Longbridge, London &amp;amp; Nottingham&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT KERV&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Kerv we harness the power of technology for the good of our people, our customers, our society and our planet. Technology is the enabler; impact is how we judge success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a certified B Corp and Great Place To Work, we care deeply about how we show up for our people, our customers and the world around us. These aren’t badges for us, they reflect how we work every day and the standards we hold ourselves to.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 900 specialists and over 1,600 technical certifications, we are bringing together expertise across cloud, AI, compliance, data, customer experience and business applications. Working as one connected team, we solve complex challenges and stay accountable from strategy through to delivery, adoption and ongoing improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help organisations build secure, well governed foundations, leverage more from their technology and unlock new opportunities through innovation and AI. Our focus is on making technology work in the real world and delivering lasting value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of the Delivery Management Team in Kerv Digital.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Kerv Digital, we help organisations unlock the power of technology to transform how they work, engage customers and drive business value. We combine deep expertise across Microsoft Business Applications, Power Platform, AI, DevOps, Data and cloud technologies. With a strong focus on outcomes and real-world value, we make digital transformation feel tangible, purposeful and fast-moving.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A politically tuned, programme delivery wizard who can establish and control several streams of work across multi-year engagements; balancing the needs of each work stream against the programme objectives and stakeholder needs. You’ll be responsible for running your programme and project teams and reporting into the Delivery Management leadership team and the operational board on programme status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All backgrounds will always be considered and experience here is far more important, we’re really open to Programme Managers that have a solid transferable background looking to deliver a mix of well governed Business Transformation, Dynamics 365 delivery, Bespoke Development projects and programmes, with a blend of agile and waterfall approaches as appropriate.&amp;nbsp; We’re looking for someone that will take responsibility for their programmes, as well as rescue and turnaround projects that have hit a roadblock (it happens occasionally!)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is also a line management position with responsibility for the pastoral care and career development of a small number of our amazing Delivery Managers and Scrum Masters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating and maintaining the environment in which the programme will succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making sure programmes, workstreams and projects are delivered beyond expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing short- and long-term objectives and ensuring programmes track against these milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing and operating governance structures within programmes to ensure effective decision making and robust assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing senior stakeholders both within Kerv Digital and our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting programme status to the Kerv Digital Leadership Team and the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting customers, listening carefully and understanding their business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with on/off-shore development/implementation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing programme and project cost and time tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and delivering change control and upsell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wrestling detailed requirements and designs into an implementable plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing an agile development process, directly and indirectly through our delivery managers and scrum masters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line management of a small team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to step into a project that needs to be reset, working with the stakeholders and the project team to turn things around&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re also looking for people that fit how we work, which is something like; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;happiest working under their own direction, but fully supported when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an obvious attention to detail, we want you to obsess about the little things!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an escalation handler, able to achieve win-win outcomes by utilising the skills across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ability to work effectively with remote teams in India / UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ability to work flexibly to deliver on-time to tight timescales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can do for you:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;We’re a transparent, honest and fiercely equal employer that believes completely in providing the best possible work experience for our employee’s: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– A healthy approach for most of our teams seems to be splitting three ways between home, customer sites and the office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awesome Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– all of our employee’s will tell you that we foster an easy going environment, are experts at what we do and care deeply about what we work on – the company was started specifically to find a way for people to take more enjoyment from their work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– these days most of our customers are household names and many of our projects have an important impact on the world around us. The kind of things we do regularly include working with not-for-profits to transform how they leverage technology, working with public bodies to shape digital services and working with top tier private entities to bring genuinely new and meaningful products and services to market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– all the usual suspects and then some. Some highlights include excellent professional development support including frequent in-house training for tech. you can’t get trained on anywhere else, private healthcare, company pension and, well stocked cupboards with tasty goodies (we’re a food first company too).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recognition &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Recognized as a &#39;Great Place to Work&#39; in both the UK and India, our commitment to excellence goes beyond our products and services. Our culture is a testament to the dedicated technologists who work tirelessly to drive our vision forward. Being a part of Kerv means embracing a culture of innovation, collaboration, and mutual respect. Our teams in the UK and India thrive in an atmosphere that promotes continuous learning and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR VALUES&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Kerv, we’re building something special and building it to last. Our values shape how we work, how we treat each other and how we deliver for our customers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think Customer First&lt;/strong&gt; – we put our customers at the heart of every decision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team is Everything&lt;/strong&gt; – we collaborate, support each other, and win together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spread Good Vibes&lt;/strong&gt; – we bring positivity, energy and respect into everything we do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Future&lt;/strong&gt; – we look ahead, innovate and create lasting impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/strong&gt; – we act with integrity and always do what’s fair and honest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who bring these values to life in how they work every day. We want everybody to feel valued, included and love working together. With an uncompromising pursuit of amazing employee experience, we always strive to do the right thing. We believe and will relentlessly promote and support the power of diversity, equality and belonging, through collaboration and creating exceptional solutions together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal opportunity statement&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from all qualified individuals regardless of age, disability, gender identity, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, gender, sexual orientation or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kerv encourages applications from people of all backgrounds, experiences and perspectives. Our recruitment decisions are based solely on skills, experience, qualifications and business needs, and we provide reasonable accommodations throughout the recruitment process where required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will live the Kerv values…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think Customer First&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team is everything&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spread good vibes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do the right thing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Kerv, we’re building something special and we’re building it to last. We want everybody to feel valued, included and love working together. With an uncompromising pursuit of amazing employee experience, we always strive to do the right thing. We believe and will relentlessly promote and support the power of diversity, equality and belonging, through collaboration and creating exceptional solutions together.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based at our Geneva, Switzerland office, with the option to work two days a week remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 10%&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1771&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;within the Quantum Platform – Devices division, you will play a key role in supporting a growing portfolio of cutting-edge products by taking ownership of day-to-day product operations. You will ensure product features are clearly defined, tracked throughout every stage of the product lifecycle and delivered successfully across cross-functional teams. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing, you will translate market and customer insights into product features for refinement by engineering teams, while leading the triage, planning and coordination of special customer projects. You will help optimise product lifecycle processes, ensuring efficient collaboration, smooth feature delivery and successful execution from concept through to launch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own product operations, ensuring features are defined, tracked throughout the product lifecycle and delivered across cross-functional teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate market and customer insights into product features, while triaging, planning and coordinating special customer projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing to optimise product lifecycle processes and drive efficient product delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will take ownership of the operational delivery of product management, ensuring products and features progress efficiently from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation. Acting as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, you will drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate delivery across multiple teams to ensure products are launched on time and to a high standard. This role is integral to enabling the Product team to scale effectively, providing operational ownership and supporting the successful delivery of an expanding product portfolio.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the operational delivery of product management, ensuring features progress from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate timely delivery across the product lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, enabling the Product team to scale beyond a single Product Manager.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of feature delivery from end to end, defining requirements and acceptance criteria, coordinating engineering handovers, validating delivery and supporting successful commercial launches. You will manage non-standard sales opportunities by assessing feasibility, making configuration decisions within agreed boundaries and documenting exceptions, while ensuring full traceability from customer requests through to delivered capability. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, you will coordinate cross-functional activities to remove blockers, maintain an accurate and prioritised Jira backlog, and respond to product enquiries from Sales. You will also prepare products for launch through documentation, training, pricing and sales enablement, maintain up-to-date product documentation, communicate complex photonic, cryogenic and networking architectures to a range of stakeholders, and represent the product in customer-facing activities including pre-sales support, technical discussions and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own end-to-end feature delivery, from requirements definition and engineering handover through to delivery validation, commercial launch and ongoing product documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, while managing Jira backlog integrity, product enquiries and non-standard sales opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support successful product adoption by communicating complex technical architectures, ensuring launch readiness, providing pre-sales support and representing the product in customer discussions and at trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will hold a Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, combined with an action-oriented mindset and the confidence to make decisions in an environment of uncertainty. You will be able to understand and reason about complex hardware products involving photonics, cryogenics and networking technologies, while communicating effectively with both technical and commercial stakeholders. You will be comfortable representing products in customer-facing situations, including technical discussions, pre-sales meetings and trade shows, and have a strong understanding of manufacturing environments, including industrialisation constraints, production realities and supply chain considerations. You will also be confident resolving conflicting priorities, negotiating with stakeholders and developing deep expertise in quantum technologies, supported by advanced Jira proficiency, including workflow configuration, automation rules and custom field management.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, with the ability to make product decisions autonomously within defined boundaries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical, commercial and customer-facing communication skills, with experience discussing complex hardware products and representing products in pre-sales meetings and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advanced Jira expertise, manufacturing and industrialisation knowledge, excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills, and a genuine curiosity for deep-tech and quantum technologies.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shift delivers AI agents that transform insurers&#39; most critical work. By combining deep industry expertise and unmatched data resources, Shift provides proven results that have earned the trust of hundreds of the world&#39;s leading insurers. Our insurance-grade AI is accurate, explainable, and secure—empowering human experts to move with unmatched speed, total confidence, and a renewed focus on the people they serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Technology :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shift is the leading AI platform for insurance. Shift combines generative, agentic, and predictive AI to detect fraud, assess risk, and recommend actions throughout the claims process. Our teams tackle complex data challenges and bring advanced models into production at scale, giving insurers deeper insights into their data while helping their customers get paid faster and enjoy a smoother claims experience. Our technology is adopted and trusted by the world’s leading insurers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Software Engineering Team 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Software Engineering team designs, builds, and maintains the applications and services that Shift’s teams rely on every day. We are Software Engineers working across the full stack, from user interfaces to back-end services. Here are just a few of the areas we work on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Front-end applications and user interfaces, mainly in React;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Back-end services and APIs, mainly in C#;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal tools that make the daily work of our Data Scientists simpler and faster;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software architecture, code quality, and reliable delivery to production;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close collaboration with Product, UX, and Data Science teams to turn real needs into working software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Product managers, UX designers, and Data Scientists, we take end-to-end ownership of what we build: from understanding the need and designing the solution to developing, deploying, and improving it over time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your key responsibilities🧑‍💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead the development of an internal project, from the first idea to a working product: a tool that helps our Data Scientists create and manage the JSON configuration files of Shift’s product features. Today these files are written by hand and are hard to read and maintain. You’ll build an interface where users select the values they need, and the tool generates the files for them. The scope is open, so you will shape it with your users. You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting our internal clients, the Data Scientists, to understand how they work today and define what the tool should do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with Product and UX teams to turn these needs into clear requirements and a simple user experience, without ready-made mock-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building the front end of the tool in React, so that users can select values and see clear, guided options for each feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing the back-end services that validate the choices and generate the JSON configuration files&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing your progress with developers and stakeholders, and collecting feedback to improve the tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying the tool and maintaining it, so that it keeps saving time for the Data Science teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along the way, you’ll discover how Engineering, Product, UX, and Data Science work together, and what the role of a developer is across all these technical jobs. This is a project you will own: you’ll learn to manage it, communicate about it, and deliver it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile and requirements✅:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in an engineering school or university program in Computer Science or Software Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid skills in &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;C#&lt;/strong&gt;, and you understand &lt;strong&gt;Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with another language, such as Java, is welcome if you are ready to learn ours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong engineering mindset, with an interest in code quality, software design, and building both front-end and back-end features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are autonomous and curious, you like to learn new tools, and you communicate clearly with technical and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can provide a 6-month internship agreement (&lt;em&gt;Convention de stage&lt;/em&gt;) signed by your school/university, starting around February 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; is mandatory at a fluent level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Shift Technology as a Full Stack Engineer Intern?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤸‍♀️Flexibility, autonomy&amp;nbsp; and adaptability are part of our core values : We are a horizontal organization without bureaucracy (65% of staff are in tech roles) but optimal and reduced line management, focus on delivery and development while having a hybrid model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠Learn from inside an AI leader tech company : Join the 13th French Licorne providing hands on training, workshop and sessions with highly experienced AI research Team.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶Your commitment, our investment : 1800€ gross monthly gratification, high&amp;nbsp; conversion rate to full time employee, dedicated HR partner, regular reviews and feedback sessions with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍Be part of an international and diverse tech firm : Full english speaking environment with 55 different nationalities across the world and 11 offices locations (Paris, Singapore, Tokyo, Sao Paulo, Mexico City, Boston, Madrid, London, Toronto, Berlin...)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝Dealing with big clients and developing business skills &amp;amp; knowledge : Real life experience with Insurance business challenges inside the world of AI.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is next ? 🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your application and experience meet our requirements, you can expect :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition interview (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical interview 1 (60 min)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring manager interview (60 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The interview process can take 2 to 3 weeks, depending on the interviewer&#39;s availability. Be sure that we are doing our best to get back to you with an answer as fast as possible. If you are not getting an update on your application after 10 days, please reach out to our email address.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To support our permanent, full time employees at every stage of their careers and lives, we provide a competitive total rewards and benefits package. Here are the global benefits we’d like to highlight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remote and hybrid working options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary and a variable component tied to personal and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multiple Learning and Development opportunities, including Focus Fridays, a half-day each month to focus on learning and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mental health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2 MAD Days per year (Make A Difference Days for paid volunteering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional benefits may be offered by country, based on your eligibility - ask your recruiter for more information. Intern and Apprentice positions may receive some of these benefits - ask your recruiter for more details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI tools are used to help review applications for this role. Read our &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shift-technology.com/hubfs/AI%20in%20Recruitment%20Notice%20May%202026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI in Recruitment Notice&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for what the AI considers, how to request a human review, and our most recent bias audit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Shift we strive to be a diverse and inclusive workforce. &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from and hire people who will contribute to the diversity of our company,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;without regard to race, color, religion, marital status, age, national or ethnic origin, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other non-merit criteria. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our application and employment process. Should you require accommodation, please email ----- and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers and only trust correspondence that comes from emails ending in &quot;shift-technology.com&quot;. We will never do initial outreach to you via Whatsapp/Text/SMS, never ask for banking information or personal identification numbers (ex. Social Security Number) as part of our recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology does not accept unsolicited CVs from recruiters or employment agencies in response to the Shift Technology Careers page or a Shift Technology social media post. Any unsolicited CVs, including those submitted directly to hiring managers, are deemed to be the property of Shift Technology. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a AI Producer do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an AI Producer to support the delivery of innovative, technology-enabled content and campaigns across multiple channels and formats. This role is ideal for a producer with agency or production-house experience who is curious about emerging AI workflows and excited to help shape the future of creative production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Producer will manage projects end-to-end while collaborating with creative, strategy, production, motion, CGI, OOH, and technology teams to deliver high-quality work on time and on budget. The role requires a strong understanding of integrated production workflows, emerging AI tools, and the operational and legal considerations involved in modern content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be highly organised, solutions-oriented, eager to learn, and passionate about production, technology, and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key day-to-day contact for clients, agency partners, and internal stakeholders across projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support communication between creative, production, AI, CGI, motion, and post-production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure project timelines, deliverables, and priorities are clearly communicated to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of client satisfaction and proactively escalate risks or concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help guide conversations around AI-enabled workflows and production efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with interdisciplinary teams including creatives, strategists, technologists, editors, motion designers, CGI artists, and external vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster strong working relationships across local and global production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor junior team members where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a positive, collaborative, and solutions-focused production culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage medium- to large-scale integrated production projects from briefing through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support productions across AI-led content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate schedules, budgets, approvals, assets, deliverables, and production workflows across multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate and implement AI tools and workflows within production pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation including timelines, trackers, meeting notes, status reports, and risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are delivered on brief, on brand, on time, and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with project scoping, budgeting, estimates, and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track project costs, vendor management, POs, billing, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with production, finance, and operations teams to ensure commercial accuracy and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost-effective production solutions while maintaining creative quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Awareness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a basic understanding of legal, compliance, and usage considerations related to AI-generated content and production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support adherence to licensing, talent usage, rights management, and content governance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure production processes align with client, platform, and company compliance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate legal or compliance concerns to relevant teams when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-Day Responsibilities May Include&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining project scopes, timelines, and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with WPP Production’s global production network to support integrated campaign launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing day-to-day communication with clients, agencies, suppliers, and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting productions involving AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with vendors and partners to obtain briefs, schedules, assets, and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing trackers, reporting documents, and workflow systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with production operations, resourcing, and traffic coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting safe innovation and experimentation with new production technologies and AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of production experience within an integrated agency, creative agency, production company, or studio environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across integrated content production including OOH, CGI, motion, film, digital, and social content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of AI tools, AI-assisted creative workflows, and emerging production technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of production and post-production processes from brief through final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of asset management, formats, usage rights, and content delivery specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of legal and compliance considerations related to production and AI-generated content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and stakeholders in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisation, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to deliver projects on time and within budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural problem solver and passion for innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
